/*
 * cinterop.gray:  Checks on the C headers named by `extern import`: header
 * preflight and cross-file header conflicts. The target C compiler is the
 * source of truth.
 *
 * Author:  Marshall A Burns <marshallbcodes@gmail.com>
 * GitHub: @SchoolyB
